    "DialogUpgradeTips": "Warm reminder: \n1. During the upgrade process, please do not remove the device or refresh the webpage, as this may cause the upgrade to fail and the device may not function properly.",
    "DialogUpgradeOperation": "Please follow the steps below to upgrade the firmware: \n1.During the upgrade process, please unplug the receiver first.\n2. Click 'Start Upgrade', a pop-up will appear in the top left corner of the browser. \n3.Select<span style='color: red; font-weight: bold'>\"Unknown device (3554: F808)\"</span>, click\"Connect\".\n4. Begin to enter the upgrade interface.",
    "DialogUpgradeUpgrading": "Hello!\n To optimize your user experience, this upgrade has fixed the known bugs. Please update the version according to the following steps:\n 1. Before upgrading, disconnect the Bluetooth and unplug the 2.4G receiver.\n 2. Switch the keyboard to the wired mode and connect the Type-C data cable to the computer port.\n 3. Click \"Start Upgrade\", and a window will pop up in the upper left corner of the browser.\n 4. Select <span style='color:red;font-weight:bold'>\"Unknown Device (3554:F808)\"</span>to enter BOOT.\n 5. Click \"Connect\" to start updating the version.\n 6. When the progress bar reaches 100%, the upgrade is successful.\n Note: Make sure that the computer network is stable. Do not plug or unplug the devices. The keyboard will be unavailable during the upgrade. Just follow the prompts. Thank you for your cooperation.",
    "upgradeTips":"Please exit to the home page and connect to wired mode to update.\n(Note: The receiver must be unplugged before upgrading!)",
    "DialogPairTips":"Please operate the keyboard to enter pairing mode (switch to wireless mode first, press and hold the Fn+4 key combination for 3 seconds until the signal light blue flashes slowly), and click \"start pairing\" near the receiver or press the space bar on the keyboard",
    "pageUpdateTips":"Detected updates in functionality or interface, click OK to clear cache and reload."
